{"name": "Nugget Royale", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/677bd7850facd32cb8dfe1d742a3b4cf.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"616\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/GamePlay.PNG?t=1746716704\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/68ae0ed9b554b59dde71c652bab79768.poster.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/68ae0ed9b554b59dde71c652bab79768.webm?t=1746716704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/68ae0ed9b554b59dde71c652bab79768.mp4?t=1746716704\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc14 Nugget Royale is a multiplayer battle royale game with chickens in a factory farm. \ud83d\udc14 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80 chicken players compete to be the last standing on an unstable disk above a gruesome grinder. The last player standing on the disk avoids being turned into a chicken nugget. Become #1 on the leaderboard and you'll be rewarded with a golden crown.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only one player can wear the crown, kings of the chickens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/CollectHATS.PNG?t=1746716704\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"566\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/86cb9d3e3af2b48e67002b25f947ed16.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"614\"/></span>Nugget Royale has over 40 unlockable hats. Hats are unlocked by winning rounds in certain stages or by your amount of chicken nuggets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nuggets unlock new hats, like a visor cap, ketchup cap, deep fry basket, and a drinking lid. Collect all the hats and show them to other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/DifferentStages.PNG?t=1746716704\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/1162cd6f4468a096af29cbfe9edb8fbf.poster.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/1162cd6f4468a096af29cbfe9edb8fbf.webm?t=1746716704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/1162cd6f4468a096af29cbfe9edb8fbf.mp4?t=1746716704\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Nugget Royale has over 14 stages with 4 different themes each with its own obstacles. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular stage, this stage is all about balancing on the disk but be careful holes may appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freezer stage, the floor is extremely slippery, it's easy to push frozen chickens off the stage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sumo stage, eat as much growth pills to push off the other chickens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saw stage, dodge the saws or you'll be chopped into a headless chicken. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/useItems.PNG?t=1746716704\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"115\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/d09a3aeccf23acc9026e8917507b54e6.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"616\"/></span>Grab items before the other players and get a time-limited boost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn players into ice cubes, blow them away like a tornado or fly away from the danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/MultiPlayer2.PNG?t=1746716704\"/></span>Compete with players from all over the world! Chaotic 80 player battles.  It can also be played locally with up to 4 players on one computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"185\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/extras/677bd7850facd32cb8dfe1d742a3b4cf.avif?t=1746716704\" width=\"616\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "CLUCK, You're a chicken fighting for your survival in a factory farm. Don't fall into the gruesome grinder or you'll be turned into a chicken nugget. The last chicken standing wins this crazy chaotic game. The winner wears the crown, making them the ultimate nugget master, king of the chickens.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158880/header.jpg?t=1746716704", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Arcade", "3D Platformer", "3D", "Cartoony"], "developers": "Pelican Party Studios", "publishers": "Pelican Party Studios", "release_date": "Feb 26, 2025", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "1158880", "re